h column). So, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim(Null}(B))=1.\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ has $3$ pivot columns and $1$ non-pivot column (namely, the $3$rd column). So, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim(Null}(C))=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{dim(Null}(A))+\\text{dim(Null}(B))+\\text{dim(Null}(C))=2+1+1=4.\n$$"] ["question-d68af87f-be02-55a7-9b78-0da04db4e309" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-f77f73c8-a6f1-5686-8eae-81626a3ac1d9" :answer-field/id #uuid "f77f73c8-a6f1-5686-8eae-81626a3ac1d9"] ["answer-75415968-8129-50a3-b6ce-101666b52758" :answer/id #uuid "75415968-8129-50a3-b6ce-101666b52758"] ["answer-75415968-8129-50a3-b6ce-101666b52758" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-75415968-8129-50a3-b6ce-101666b52758" :answer/value "1"] ["answer-982cdb38-b85b-58e9-9088-665bbeac8223" :answer/id #uuid "982cdb38-b85b-58e9-9088-665bbeac8223"] ["answer-982cdb38-b85b-58e9-9088-665bbeac8223" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-982cdb38-b85b-58e9-9088-665bbeac8223" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-223b7f24-1bf6-5866-97dd-305c2bfc6faa" :answer/id #uuid "223b7f24-1bf6-5866-97dd-305c2bfc6faa"] ["answer-223b7f24-1bf6-5866-97dd-305c2bfc6faa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-223b7f24-1bf6-5866-97dd-305c2bfc6faa" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-787219f1-94ee-53fb-a49b-8777fcdb7957" :answer/id #uuid "787219f1-94ee-53fb-a49b-8777fcdb7957"] ["answer-787219f1-94ee-53fb-a49b-8777fcdb7957" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-787219f1-94ee-53fb-a49b-8777fcdb7957" :answer/value "4"] ["answer-feb82dbb-03db-5058-b53a-495b57a7a067" :answer/id #uuid "feb82dbb-03db-5058-b53a-495b57a7a067"] ["answer-feb82dbb-03db-5058-b53a-495b57a7a067" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-feb82dbb-03db-5058-b53a-495b57a7a067" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-field-f77f73c8-a6f1-5686-8eae-81626a3ac1d9" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-f77f73c8-a6f1-5686-8eae-81626a3ac1d9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-f77f73c8-a6f1-5686-8eae-81626a3ac1d9" :answer-field/correct 